      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding a comment to bump this hopefully. The number of use cases for something like this would be insane. MMO games and other game worlds, events, even home worlds. \n\nOne use case I want this for is a portal in my home world to lead me straight into a group world once I get vr and full body set up. Then say that group world has a hub like map that you can met people and find something to do with the portals in the map. And in this case, the portals would be able to track how full the instance is and start creating new instances when it is.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
